WEBVTT

00:01:52.533 --> 00:01:55.103
Not bad, pretty boy.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:56.370
Shut up!

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:01.770
Great. Let's play more, boy!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:04.470
Oops.

00:02:05.533 --> 00:02:07.603
Target Six is approaching you.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:12.330
Authorizing it now as your target.
Okay?

00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:15.126
Understood.
I have her in my sights.

00:02:18.566 --> 00:02:21.566
Entertain me, cute little girl.

00:02:22.933 --> 00:02:25.773
What's the matter?
Is the game of tag over already?

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.570
Since we can't run,
we just have to fight, maro.

00:02:29.766 --> 00:02:30.766
Marumaro...

00:02:32.533 --> 00:02:34.473
What's the matter?
You're not going to attack?

00:02:34.766 --> 00:02:38.066
Then...I'll attack first!

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.900
What's this?!

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.196
What's the big idea?

00:02:48.533 --> 00:02:52.103
Battle must be beautiful and thrilling.

00:02:52.566 --> 00:02:55.266
I thought it'd be more elegant
this way than just fighting.

00:02:56.066 --> 00:03:00.096
Interesting...
But don't regret it.

00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:03.666
Right back at you!

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.100
Another Shadow Wielder, huh?

00:03:11.766 --> 00:03:13.766
How many of you are there?!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.970
We're the Independent Flying Squadron
under General Logi's command.

00:03:18.266 --> 00:03:20.426
You guys are mice caught in a trap.

00:03:20.866 --> 00:03:25.466
You've got nowhere to run.
As long as Alfheim and I are here.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:37.270
I was told to run, but I've reached my limit!
Let's fight, Blue Dragon!

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.300
What is it?!

00:03:42.533 --> 00:03:44.103
Blue Dragon, huh?

00:03:52.366 --> 00:03:54.166
General Logi...

00:03:54.533 --> 00:03:57.403
The power that defeated
Gustov and Ivanov...

00:03:59.033 --> 00:04:00.603
Show it to me!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:06.170
ESCAPE THROUGH THE ENEMY FRONT

00:04:20.733 --> 00:04:22.373
General Logi...

00:04:22.566 --> 00:04:24.366
Rose in May!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.830
The enemy even Zola
couldn't defeat...

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.070
That Shu...

00:04:43.666 --> 00:04:46.896
Let me hear your name.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.670
If you don't know. Remember it.

00:04:50.066 --> 00:04:53.426
My name's Shu!
Shu, the Shadow Wielder!

00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:57.366
Let me tell you this.
I'm not like I was back then!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.270
So it seems.

00:05:05.433 --> 00:05:07.933
Logi! Fight me!

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.270
Very well.

00:05:17.033 --> 00:05:20.573
The power of Blue Dragon
Zola was seeking.

00:05:21.133 --> 00:05:25.433
I'll test it out firsthand.
Go, Valkyrie!

00:05:26.933 --> 00:05:27.603
As you wish!

00:05:31.066 --> 00:05:34.666
Blue Dragon, don't get too close!
That sword's trouble!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:35.700
Shut up!

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.170
Don't pretend like you know
what you're talking about!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.770
Wow!

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.170
Don't be surprised!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:13.070
We can do something like that
if you were better!

00:06:13.433 --> 00:06:14.703
Shut up!

00:06:18.966 --> 00:06:23.466
I know that.
I need to be more...

00:06:28.066 --> 00:06:30.696
So even the great Miss Zola
is having a hard time

00:06:30.733 --> 00:06:33.533
adjusting to our
new battle technique?

00:06:33.933 --> 00:06:37.603
Can you only fight
in this half-baked way?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.870
I'm mortified that you'd say that.

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:43.166
The Chain Duel is
a respected duel technique.

00:06:43.866 --> 00:06:48.196
It levels the playing field,
fair and square.

00:07:02.133 --> 00:07:06.503
Deucalion's chain is the perfect length.
Not too long. Not too short, either.

00:07:06.866 --> 00:07:09.226
The perfect length for a chain duel.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.600
Efficiency is beauty.

00:07:11.733 --> 00:07:14.233
The length of this chain is perfect

00:07:14.266 --> 00:07:17.826
and it can only be appreciated by someone
who has mastered the art of battle!

00:07:18.966 --> 00:07:21.126
That's enough talking.

00:07:21.366 --> 00:07:23.966
I hear that men who talk too much
aren't popular.

00:07:24.366 --> 00:07:25.796
What did you say?

00:07:26.066 --> 00:07:28.526
I'm sick of listening to that babble.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.400
Waves of Rage!

00:07:43.633 --> 00:07:45.373
That's some incredible power.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:51.030
It seems even Yarovit is
no match for your power.

00:07:51.866 --> 00:07:56.796
I bet if we fight you all day like that,
we'd be too exhausted.

00:07:56.833 --> 00:07:59.003
We'd barely be able to stand up!

00:07:59.033 --> 00:08:00.233
Good point.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:05.870
Then how about just taking one shot
without making a fuss, old lady?

00:08:05.966 --> 00:08:08.166
Who's an old lady?!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.970
I'm still a "young lady."

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.430
Got that?!

00:08:12.666 --> 00:08:13.826
Oh, scary.

00:08:14.133 --> 00:08:16.703
It's like you're just before
the expiration date.

00:08:17.033 --> 00:08:19.833
Boy, shut your Shadow up.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:22.900
Heck no.

00:08:23.033 --> 00:08:24.573
Oh, I see.

00:08:24.866 --> 00:08:27.726
It seems you need
some punishment!

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.870
Call me "young lady"!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.400
Is this all you've got?

00:08:55.066 --> 00:08:56.326
Shu! Here he comes!

00:08:56.366 --> 00:08:57.026
What?!

00:08:58.833 --> 00:09:01.203
Swirling Gloom!

00:09:22.433 --> 00:09:25.103
I'm shocked that you'd challenge
Master Logi with your skill.

00:09:25.133 --> 00:09:26.673
I don't even know what to say.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.630
It seems like I won't even need
my secret techniques to win.

00:09:30.066 --> 00:09:32.096
Let's not drag this out.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:35.330
As you wish. I'll finish them off now.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.430
Don't...mess with me.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.570
The fight's only just started!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.970
It seems you're moving
a little bit better than earlier.

00:09:55.533 --> 00:09:59.003
Haven't you
slowed down some, maro?

00:09:59.566 --> 00:10:00.996
I'm at thirty percent.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:02.570
Maro?!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.970
I'm at thirty percent speed now.

00:10:09.433 --> 00:10:12.433
If you want, I could bring it
up to forty percent.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.570
That was thirty percent?

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:20.830
M-M-Maro! What're you
talking about, maro?!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.070
We're just getting started.

00:10:23.466 --> 00:10:28.996
Let's see, ten minus three
and carry the one...isn't five...

00:10:29.033 --> 00:10:31.333
Two, two percent, maro!

00:10:31.533 --> 00:10:32.203
Huh?

00:10:32.533 --> 00:10:36.403
Oh-ho...
Two percent, huh? That's incredible.

00:10:36.933 --> 00:10:40.903
Saber Tiger and I are incredible
once we get serious, maro!

00:10:41.133 --> 00:10:46.173
Incredible when we get to
one hundred percent, maro!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.130
Clearly a bluff.

00:10:48.933 --> 00:10:51.833
Marumaro, even Kluke
has seen through it.

00:10:51.866 --> 00:10:57.366
I-I-It's no lie, maro!
We're incredible, maro!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.930
We're faster, maro!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.570
Then show me.

00:11:02.666 --> 00:11:04.726
We'll go faster than that!

00:11:06.166 --> 00:11:10.326
Let's go, maro!
One thousand percent, maro!

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.500
Roger!

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.500
Th-They both vanished.

00:11:21.933 --> 00:11:23.803
W-Wow...

00:11:33.366 --> 00:11:34.026
Maro!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:37.670
Maro?!

00:11:39.133 --> 00:11:40.773
Feather Storm!

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:43.270
Maro?!

00:12:12.966 --> 00:12:14.566
Run, run...

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:18.370
If you think you can
escape from Isabel...

00:12:18.866 --> 00:12:21.366
Well, it's useless to run, though!

00:12:58.133 --> 00:12:58.803
My clothes...

00:13:02.433 --> 00:13:06.003
What's up with this?!

00:13:06.566 --> 00:13:10.326
This is just sexual harassment!

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.530
Lecher! Pervert!
Disgusting!

00:13:13.633 --> 00:13:15.873
It's against the law!

00:13:16.066 --> 00:13:17.826
I'll sue you!

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:25.030
I'll end up getting naked like this!

00:13:26.733 --> 00:13:29.733
Well, that's the goal.

00:13:33.266 --> 00:13:36.566
Oh...I know.
I should get naked!

00:13:39.766 --> 00:13:41.126
This will seal the deal!

00:13:47.333 --> 00:13:50.973
Okay, I'm going to disappear!
Vanish-vanish!

00:13:51.166 --> 00:13:51.826
What?!

00:13:54.666 --> 00:13:56.196
With this I can rest easy now!

00:13:56.666 --> 00:13:58.396
I should've thought of it sooner.

00:14:12.466 --> 00:14:14.826
Come on! What's the matter?

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.130
Have you run out of steam already?

00:14:17.566 --> 00:14:21.396
You're not much considering
you're Miss Zola's Shadow.

00:14:23.333 --> 00:14:27.633
Don't get carried away.
Don't underestimate Killer Bat's power.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.200
There!

00:14:35.366 --> 00:14:36.026
What?!

00:14:38.433 --> 00:14:39.433
It's over!

00:14:39.633 --> 00:14:41.303
I'm just getting started!

00:14:48.333 --> 00:14:49.333
Here's the finishing blow!

00:14:54.433 --> 00:14:56.403
So you're going to take off the chains.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.930
So after all that talk, that's the extent
of your determination, huh?

00:15:00.166 --> 00:15:05.096
There's no reason why I should
just let you hurt Deucalion!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:11.230
Hornet Pierce!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:23.370
I'm going to give you the chance
to enjoy this defeat.

00:15:23.533 --> 00:15:25.673
You're not even worth
the effort of eliminating.

00:15:32.333 --> 00:15:33.773
Miss Zola...

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:43.870
What?!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.070
Where'd they go?
Did they hide?

00:15:53.266 --> 00:15:55.866
It's not like we were hiding.

00:15:56.033 --> 00:15:59.373
You just lost sight of me
after we dodged the attack.

00:15:59.766 --> 00:16:02.326
Make sure you keep
your eye on me, okay?

00:16:06.466 --> 00:16:08.096
Oh, is that so?!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:13.000
You punched him.
You punched my Yarovit.

00:16:13.466 --> 00:16:14.126
Huh?

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.770
What're you talking about, old lady?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.800
Not the face! I told you!

00:16:19.066 --> 00:16:20.326
No, you didn't.

00:16:20.533 --> 00:16:25.503
The face is most important to a woman.
What if she couldn't get married?!

00:16:25.533 --> 00:16:27.373
What the heck are
you talking about?!

00:16:27.966 --> 00:16:29.596
Unforgivable.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:35.130
I'll torment you to death.
So prepare yourself!

00:16:42.366 --> 00:16:45.026
Eat this! Impact Drive!

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.470
What're you doing, Shu?!

00:16:58.133 --> 00:17:00.103
Here we've got a worthy opponent.

00:17:00.433 --> 00:17:02.973
But there's no competition
with you like that!

00:17:03.833 --> 00:17:05.733
I know that!

00:17:08.633 --> 00:17:11.103
Hey, Shu! You know, right?

00:17:11.433 --> 00:17:12.603
About what?!

00:17:12.966 --> 00:17:14.966
Indeed, they are strong.

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:16.770
But...

00:17:17.133 --> 00:17:18.173
Yeah.

00:17:19.566 --> 00:17:25.796
Blue Dragon might have
more potential than Valkyrie.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:26.670
What?!

00:17:27.466 --> 00:17:28.466
Master Logi...

00:17:29.066 --> 00:17:34.326
But as you can see, there's an absolute
difference between you and me.

00:17:34.366 --> 00:17:39.226
And you can't make it up
even with Blue Dragon's power.

00:17:39.766 --> 00:17:41.026
What?!

00:17:42.033 --> 00:17:43.173
It's trust.

00:17:45.666 --> 00:17:46.726
You lack skill.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:50.530
You're not using all
that power efficiently at all.

00:17:50.833 --> 00:17:52.873
You're wasting the treasure
you've been given.

00:17:53.366 --> 00:17:54.566
Shut up!

00:18:05.766 --> 00:18:07.366
Hey, Blue Dragon!

00:18:07.566 --> 00:18:09.996
About the difference
between him and me...

00:18:10.466 --> 00:18:12.196
What did he mean by "trust"?

00:18:12.633 --> 00:18:13.903
Are you a moron?

00:18:14.333 --> 00:18:16.503
This isn't the time for you to be
shaken by the enemy's words!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:21.070
Does it mean that we
don't believe in each other?!

00:18:21.633 --> 00:18:23.133
Knock it off, Shu!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.070
This isn't the time to waver!
Believe!

00:18:27.666 --> 00:18:29.896
Believe in your own power, Shu!

00:18:38.866 --> 00:18:40.226
Blue Dragon!

00:18:40.633 --> 00:18:43.373
Looks like you're here,
but your mind isn't.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.170
Battle isn't a game.

00:18:45.866 --> 00:18:48.026
There's only death
if you don't fight seriously.

00:18:48.566 --> 00:18:53.426
Sorry, but I've been ordered by Lord Nene,
so I'm going to put an end to this here.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.370
Shu! Don't waver!

00:18:57.733 --> 00:19:01.833
Try using me effectively!
You're a Shadow Wielder, aren't you?!

00:19:02.033 --> 00:19:03.033
Prepare yourself!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.100
You're my Shadow Wielder, aren't you?!

00:19:10.466 --> 00:19:11.126
What?!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.630
I will believe in my power.

00:19:16.466 --> 00:19:18.266
Jeez, it's about time!

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:24.970
Blue Dragon's claws are glowing!
Is this some new technique?!

00:19:26.166 --> 00:19:28.666
What're you doing?!
Next!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.100
Right!
Let's go, Blue Dragon!

00:19:32.566 --> 00:19:33.226
Shu!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:37.800
What's this I'm feeling?!

00:19:37.833 --> 00:19:41.173
Knockout technique! Fire Crisis!

00:20:04.033 --> 00:20:05.233
Did we do it?

00:20:05.766 --> 00:20:07.266
No, not yet.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:19.170
True to the name of Blue Dragon,
I suppose.

00:20:19.366 --> 00:20:22.296
I'm surprised that you could
inflict damage on Valkyrie.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:26.870
However, this isn't over yet, boy!

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.070
Shu!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.900
Hornet Assassin!

00:20:38.666 --> 00:20:39.666
We're clearing out!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:40.670
What?

00:20:40.833 --> 00:20:41.833
Just move!

00:20:56.333 --> 00:20:58.633
So they ran away, huh?
That's a good decision.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:20:59.800
Master Logi...

00:21:01.233 --> 00:21:02.503
Pretty interesting.

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:08.570
Now I want to see a little more.

00:21:09.733 --> 00:21:10.403
We're pulling out?!

00:21:10.666 --> 00:21:12.826
What? We've only just started.

00:21:12.866 --> 00:21:14.426
It's General Logi's order.

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:18.700
I'm definitely going to pay back,
Miss Zola.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.700
Everyone, pull out! Got it?

00:21:22.166 --> 00:21:23.166
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.270
See you later, boy.

00:21:25.466 --> 00:21:26.466
Hold it!

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:33.470
We'll probably see each other again.
Look forward to it.

00:21:34.566 --> 00:21:35.566
Their presence...

00:21:35.933 --> 00:21:37.003
They vanished, maro.

00:21:46.833 --> 00:21:48.573
Point 5337...

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:52.330
Dragnov's fleet was supposed to
be deployed there, right?

00:21:53.066 --> 00:21:54.626
The very lucky Dragnov...

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:57.370
The previous operation
was a failure,

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:59.100
but I recall him being
an excellent commander

00:21:59.133 --> 00:22:01.473
who distinguished himself
in battle many times.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.230
But you sure are wicked,
General Logi.

00:22:05.433 --> 00:22:07.473
What do you mean?

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.600
Instead of just defeating them today,

00:22:09.633 --> 00:22:13.873
you can distinguish yourself more
if the enemy has proven themselves first.

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:16.133
Don't overestimate me.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:20.630
I simply avoided a reckless pursuit because
I sensed an unknown power in them.

00:22:20.833 --> 00:22:25.133
I see... Then allow me to take back
my previous inappropriate comment.

00:22:26.133 --> 00:22:28.673
So...what will you do now, Zola?

00:24:22.500 --> 00:24:24.930
Thanks to his father
Dragnov's elite special training,

00:24:24.966 --> 00:24:28.126
Shu develops
his new special attack.

00:24:28.166 --> 00:24:31.726
The fire disappeared right before my eyes!
A special attack that disappears?!

00:24:31.766 --> 00:24:35.296
Did you see that, Jiro?!
This is the Great Fire Crisis Two!

00:24:35.333 --> 00:24:37.333
Um... It won't hit if
it disappears, you know.

00:24:37.633 --> 00:24:40.473
Next time on Blue Dragon:
"Dragnov's Last Stand."
